# Absolute Convex URL, for example https://your-deployment.convex.cloud
# Vite inlines this at dev and build time. Routing Middleware also reads it
# at runtime and calls the matching .convex.site HTTP action for /{slug}.
# A missing or non-absolute value leaves the landing page in the not-configured
# state, and slug requests redirect to /unknown.
VITE_CONVEX_URL=

# Optional runtime override for the slug redirect. When unset, middleware
# derives the Convex HTTP origin from VITE_CONVEX_URL (.convex.cloud → .convex.site).
CONVEX_SITE_URL=

